Package: synthid
Title: Cross-Year Person Linkage and Synthetic ID Assignment for Nonprofit Compensation Panels
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jesse", "Lecy", email = "jdlecy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds a stable cross-year person identifier ("EMP_ID") for panels of
    IRS Form 990 director/officer/trustee compensation records. Consumes the parsed
    output of the titleclassifier and peopleparser packages (name components and
    standardized titles), links records of the same person across tax years within
    an organization, resolves the pairwise links into connected-component clusters,
    and stamps one deterministic synthetic identifier on every record of a person.
    Record comparison uses reclin2 with a compound last-name comparator and a
    within-organization surname-frequency adjustment so that agreement on a common
    family surname carries little weight on a family-dominated board.
